            %p
              is. Indeed, this is one step in the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+sequence"} fiber sequence
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi ⋯
                    %mo →
                    %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
