              preserves limits and hence looping and delooping)
          .un_prop
            %h6#proposition_16 Proposition
            %p
              The differential cohomology group
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
