          .un_remark
            %h6#remark_6 Remark
            %p
              This is essentially the short exact sequence whose form is familiar from the traditional definition of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/ordinary+differential+cohomology"} ordinary differential cohomology
              only up to the following slight nuances in notation:
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  The cohomology groups of the short exact sequence above denote the groups obtained in the given
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/%28%E2%88%9E%2C1%29-topos"} (∞,1)-topos
                  = succeed "," do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mstyle{:mathvariant => "bold"}
                            %mi H
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathbf{H}
