          %h3#ChernSimonsTheory Higher holonomy and Chern-Simons functional
          %p
            The notion of
            %a{:href => "#ChernWeilTheory"} intrinsic ∞-connections
            in a cohesive
            = succeed "-topos" do
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
