            %h6#remark_7 Remark
            %p
              In the language of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/sigma-model"} sigma-model
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/quantum+field+theory"} quantum field theory
              the ingredients of this definition have the following interpretation
            %ul
              %li
                %p
                  %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
